Additional dependencies
-----------------------

Other Rust dependencies declare their licenses in their package manifests.
The Talos source release contains workspace manifests; Cargo.lock is generated
during the build and is not tracked in the source archive. Each dependency
retains its own license and notices in its source package. In particular,
packages with a choice of licenses may be used under any license offered by
that package; this notice does not relicense them.

The dependency versions above were present in the generated Cargo.lock used
to prepare this candidate. Inspect the lockfile and Cargo metadata from the
actual product build for its complete resolved dependency set; versions may
differ when dependencies are resolved again.
